# Fixture - sample 模块

> 本模块所有接口统一通过通用命令 \`anycli request fixture <METHOD> <path>\` 调用。
> 调用前先按需读取 references/ 下对应文件查参数结构，不要猜字段。

## 路由优先级（何时用本模块）

出现以下语义时优先走本模块：
- sample
- 描述回退
- 样品单列表
- 创建样品单
- ID
- 修改样品单
- 解析收货地址
- 样品单详情
- 不分页
- 批量确认需求

**判定规则：** 只要最终动作涉及sample相关操作，就归本模块。

## 选哪个接口

| 想做什么 | 接口 | 方式 | 按需读取 reference |
|---------|------|------|-------------------|
| Javadoc 描述回退 | \`javadoc-only-describe\` | GET | [reference](references/javadoc-only-describe.md) |
| 样品单列表 | \`sample-order-list-page\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-list-page.md) |
| 获取状态统计数 | \`sample-order-list-status-count\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-list-status-count.md) |
| 获取领用用途配置 | \`sample-order-list-purpose-config\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-list-purpose-config.md) |
| 创建样品单，返回保存的多条样品单 ID | \`sample-order-create\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-create.md) |
| 修改样品单 | \`sample-order-update\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-update.md) |
| 检验地址相似度 | \`sample-order-check-address-similar\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-check-address-similar.md) |
| 忽略样品单物流异常 | \`sample-order-ignore-exception\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-ignore-exception.md) |
| 解析收货地址 | \`sample-order-parse-address\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-parse-address.md) |
| 获取当前用户最后一次录入的公司收货人信息 | \`sample-order-get-last-company-consignee-info\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-get-last-company-consignee-info.md) |
| 样品单详情 | \`sample-order-get-details\` | GET | [reference](references/sample-order-get-details.md) |
| 样品单编辑信息 | \`sample-order-get-details-by-update\` | GET | [reference](references/sample-order-get-details-by-update.md) |
| 修改样品是否需要退回 | \`sample-order-update-sample-is-need-return\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-update-sample-is-need-return.md) |
| 作废样品单；草稿、待提审状态下的作废 | \`sample-order-cancel-sample-order\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-cancel-sample-order.md) |
| 批量作废样品单；草稿、待提审状态下的作废 | \`sample-order-batch-cancel-sample-order\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-batch-cancel-sample-order.md) |
| 手动新增物流单号 | \`sample-order-add-delivery\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-add-delivery.md) |
| 手动更新物流单号 | \`sample-order-update-delivery\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-update-delivery.md) |
| 获取所有物流公司，不分页 | \`sample-order-list-all-delivery-company\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-list-all-delivery-company.md) |
| 校验客户是否有重复样品单 | \`sample-order-check-customer-repeat-sample-order\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-check-customer-repeat-sample-order.md) |
| 导出样品单信息 | \`sample-order-export-sample-order\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-export-sample-order.md) |
| 导入样品单信息 | \`sample-order-import-sample-order\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-import-sample-order.md) |
| 客户主页链接异常待办列表 | \`sample-order-error-todo-list\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-error-todo-list.md) |
| 批量确认需求，仅会确认草稿状态的 | \`sample-order-batch-confirm\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-batch-confirm.md) |
| 获取样品单统计数据 | \`sample-order-get-stat-data\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-get-stat-data.md) |
| 更新物流信息，单个更新 | \`sample-order-update-sample-order-delivery\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-update-sample-order-delivery.md) |
| 修改样品单为无需邮寄；传样品单 id | \`sample-order-update-sample-order-no-send\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-update-sample-order-no-send.md) |
| 手动签收物流单 | \`sample-order-manual-sign\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-manual-sign.md) |
| 取消样品单，待发货状态下 | \`sample-order-cancel-sample-order-by-cmd\` | POST | [reference](references/sample-order-cancel-sample-order-by-cmd.md) |
| 按路径参数删除 | \`synthetic-remove\` | DELETE | [reference](references/synthetic-remove.md) |
| 按路径参数查详情（PathVariable 省略 name） | \`synthetic-detail\` | GET | [reference](references/synthetic-detail.md) |
| OpenAPI3 summary 回退 | \`synthetic-multi-path-a\` | GET | [reference](references/synthetic-multi-path-a.md) |
| RequestMapping 多路径数组 + method 属性 | \`synthetic-via-mapping-a\` | GET | [reference](references/synthetic-via-mapping-a.md) |
| RequestMapping method=PUT | \`synthetic-put-via-request-mapping\` | PUT | [reference](references/synthetic-put-via-request-mapping.md) |
| 方法级占位符 | \`synthetic-echo\` | POST | [reference](references/synthetic-echo.md) |
| PATCH 映射 | \`synthetic-patch-status\` | PATCH | [reference](references/synthetic-patch-status.md) |
| 默认值与必填混合 | \`synthetic-query-with-default\` | GET | [reference](references/synthetic-query-with-default.md) |

## 处理链

- **样品单列表 → 创建样品单，返回保存的多条样品单 ID**：\`sample-order-list-page\` → \`sample-order-create\`
- **样品单编辑信息 → 创建样品单，返回保存的多条样品单 ID**：\`sample-order-get-details-by-update\` → \`sample-order-create\`
- **导入样品单信息 → 创建样品单，返回保存的多条样品单 ID**：\`sample-order-import-sample-order\` → \`sample-order-create\`
- **样品单列表 → 修改样品单**：\`sample-order-list-page\` → \`sample-order-update\`
- **样品单编辑信息 → 修改样品单**：\`sample-order-get-details-by-update\` → \`sample-order-update\`
- **导入样品单信息 → 修改样品单**：\`sample-order-import-sample-order\` → \`sample-order-update\`

## 错误处理

| 错误码 / 现象 | 判断 | 动作 |
|--------------|------|------|
| AUTH_EXPIRED | Session 过期 | \`anycli auth login\` 重新登录 |
| FORBIDDEN | 无权限 | 检查用户角色，不要重试 |

